---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="页面未找到 · 知识专栏" description="你访问的页面不存在或已被移动">
	<section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-36 pb-24">
		<div class="absolute inset-0 grid-pattern"></div>
		<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6">
			<p class="text-sm font-medium text-primary">404</p>
			<h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">页面未找到</h1>
			<p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
				这个地址没有对应内容，可能链接已失效，或文章尚未发布。
			</p>
			<div class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
				<a
					href="/"
					class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-primary px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground shadow-lg shadow-primary/25 transition-all hover:scale-105"
				>
					返回首页
				</a>
				<a
					href="/blog"
					class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition-all hover:bg-secondary hover:scale-105"
				>
					浏览文章
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
